 other orders as this Court deems fit.\n\nAND FOR THIS ACT OF KINDNESS THE PLAINTIFF SHALL AS IN DUTY BOUND EVER PRAY.\n\nPlace: [City]\nDate: DD.MM.YYYY\n\n[Advocate Name]\nEnrolment No.:\n\nVERIFICATION: Verified at [place] on DD.MM.YYYY.\n\nANNEXURE LIST:\n| Annexure | Document | Date |\n[Title documents, supporting evidence]\n\n=== TRACKING TABLE ===\n| Section | Status | Issues |\n|---------|--------|--------|\n| Plaintiff's right established | | |\n| Defendant's denial documented | | |\n| Need for declaration | | |\n| Jurisdiction and limitation | | |\n| Court fee | | |\n| Prayer | | |\n| Verification | | |\n\nContext:\n{{CONTEXT}}\n\nInstructions:\n{{INSTRUCTIONS}}"
