ement | Status | Issues |\n|---------|--------|--------|\n| Notice type identified | | |\n| Recipient details complete | | |\n| Purpose clear | | |\n| Time for response | | |\n| Consequence of non-response | | |\n| Date and signature | | |\n\nContext:\n{{CONTEXT}}\n\nInstructions:\n{{INSTRUCTIONS}}"
